  "observations": [
    "Protected current SearchReplay compilation/replay terminal0 on unit qa-harness-d7152b9ff71c45729b928509e976246f.scope invocation9abe5fc7cf6743dc83e93a5121ac8818. All original rank/metadata/Unicode/current-query/refusal/Unknown/no-match assertions and three additional literal policy witnesses pass.",
