    "First protected trial compiled successfully but replay failed because root driver assumed nonexistent /usr/bin/node. Retained unchanged. Corrected driver uses installed Node and retains its path/hash; new output directory preserves first failure.",
    "Protected locale adapter-to-compiled-matching fixture passes: unit qa-harness-d648030ae74d4daab13b5915da36eb16.scope invocation9f54d9eb7b0f4c5bbc69f112c08dcd6d, report f108161fad62094b1f1645d402f3f4dcb6979e3fa0276e4e4cf5524e532a5a78. Four controlled LC_ALL/LC_MESSAGES/LANG/C cases exercise actual isolated desktop metadata, locale precedence/fallback and shared-cache changes through real Authority.snapshot into compiled Catalog.decode/search. Localized names/generic names/keywords, stable identity ties, multiword matches, absent and native-only Exec negatives pass; numeric authority generation is rejected. 148 source hashes unchanged. No command is launched.",
    "First locale fixture fails because root expected IDs with .desktop suffix; actual established adapter strips the suffix at taskbar_catalog.py87. Original failure, driver and actual compiled results are preserved; corrected expectation changes no production behavior or matching oracle.",
    "Protected native initial/held-loading trial passes with normal owned cleanup. Initial publication20/lease1 shows empty focused launcher-search and actual visible AT status Type to search applications.; Loading publication33/lease1 shows editor with actual visible AT status Loading applications\u2026 and matching AT reader/entry identity322. Genuine catalog frame remains held through physical Enter and both observations with no dispatch/recipient, then the exact held frame is released through the original daemon send path. Same-publication popup/bar live lease is checked before and after capture. Root viewed both actual full-output images; independent review remains pending.",
    "Independent v1 source review stopped missing current popup lease binding before execution; v2 adds live bar publication/lease equality and independent delta review found no source stop. Both reviews retained; v1 never executed.",
    "Independent quint-5 whole original UI005 acceptance after independently viewing both native images and rehashing all 367 native source inputs. Five named scenario dispositions remain their original observed scopes and tuples; unchanged query/generation logic and current changed-boundary receipts support explicit bounded reuse. This is one whole-requirement adjudication, not five newly executed scenarios."
